35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The truck comes at 7:40! That’s way too early for me.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found the subsidy covers 40% of setup, capped at 90k.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The clerk says a permanent build needs five signatures and four months.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The subsidy is nice, but the station block fell apart in two years.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The ledger shows 34k yen a year in extra fees from open bags.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,7:40 is terrible. I can’t sleep through that noise.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"So we save 90k on setup, but we still pay 34k yearly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,Four months is a long time. We need a faster option.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"If it breaks in two years, the subsidy is a trap.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,The fees are from open bags. We need a lid or a rule.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,Can we move the truck time? Or build a sound barrier?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,A sound barrier might cost more than the subsidy covers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,A temporary shelter is faster. But it might not last.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,I want to know the hours. How much time does this take?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The statements say nobody wants to police the bags. That’s the problem.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,I think we need a covered bin that’s quiet.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,A covered bin with a lock might work. Let’s see the options.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,A lock prevents open bags. But who holds the key?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"If it’s a hassle, people will stop using it. I need to know the time cost.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"If we don’t assign responsibility, the fees will stay high. We need a plan.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
